2026-07-27T09:28:24.8512517Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8573163Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8573966Z i /tmp/RtmpVOlDON/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8574502Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8575120Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8575678Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8576567Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8577839Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8579260Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8825215Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:28:24.8935730Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:28:24.9376356Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T09:28:24.9534705Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
